WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.520
Let's test the wrong idea.

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:03.807
Can a new piece join the 5-prime

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:04.144
end?

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:05.258
Try it.

00:00:05.792 --> 00:00:06.129
Nope.

00:00:06.466 --> 00:00:07.673
It bounces right off.

00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:09.415
Now try the 3-prime end.

00:00:10.042 --> 00:00:10.460
Click.

00:00:11.087 --> 00:00:11.760
It fits.

00:00:12.608 --> 00:00:14.140
Like a puzzle piece that only fits

00:00:14.186 --> 00:00:14.999
on one side.

00:00:15.452 --> 00:00:17.669
Pieces always join the 3-prime end, so

00:00:17.739 --> 00:00:19.469
DNA grows 5-prime to 3-prime.

00:00:20.096 --> 00:00:21.512
Now try the question again.
